{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>One of the people.</b> According to its plain sense: one of the people, whether great or small, like ״כי בא אחד העם״ in Samuel." "<b>And you would have brought guilt upon us.</b> By means of the oath, if you had lied to me and my descendants, for one is liable to an אשם offering for transgression of an oath, as we find regarding one who denies a deposit and swears and then confesses."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:02.930871039Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}